      "writtenOn": "2021-08-03T05:49:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Reconsidering:\n\nWe may be stuck in this while() loop for milliseconds. CC_STATUS events may be received in the midst of RX packet overflow. This would get wiped along with the RX packets.\n\nIt may be safer to clear the TCPC_REG_ALERT_RX_STATUS + TCPC_REG_ALERT_RX_BUF_OVF bits ONLY, then allow other handlers (L1224 and below) to proceed.\n\nMissing a CC_STATUS event would cause a state desynch for certain.",
      "parentUuid": "7c734c4b_180a3d57",
      "revId": "40894dac8e58352e77d191a3a2b1b5cbe2991aa5",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
